    "detailed_description": "Conspiracy is available on Steam Jan  20th. Please Wishlist.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nConspiracy! is a detective game that takes you on a journey into the heart of the Deep State. Only you can figure out the hidden truth.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn investigative puzzle game that asks you to piece together a hidden conspiracy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is a detective puzzle scenario, in which players may inspect sources, documents, audio logs, and records in order to solve the puzzles contained.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game takes place on one screen containing all the resources. The player will piece together the story chapter by chapter, receiving validation every 5th correct chapter.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe player will experience an uproarious, satirical comedy, while also engaging in the sort of logical deduction found in Return of the Obra Dinn and Her Story.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game combines written, audio, visual and meta-game puzzles to create an enthralling experience. It plays for roughly 2-3 hours.",
